Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: bfd/coffgen.c
Line: 3142
Function: is_subsection
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: When str starts with prefix and is exactly prefix + '$' (e.g., ".didat$"), the code reads str[n + 2] without ensuring it is within bounds. This results in a 1-byte read past the NUL terminator.

